  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁϥϩⲟⲛϩⲉⲛ ⲉⲧⲟⲧⲟⲩ ϩⲓⲛⲁ ⲛⲧⲟⲩϣⲧⲉⲙϫⲟⲥ ⲛ**ϩⲗⲓ** ϩⲟⲥⲇⲉ ⲙⲁⲗⲗⲟⲛ ⲛⲁⲩϩⲓⲱⲓϣ ⲛϩⲟⲩⲟ",
      "english": "He commanded them that they should tell no one, but the more he commanded them, so much the more widely they proclaimed it.",
      "source": "Bohairic Gospel of Mark 7 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:7",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
